62	WorkPackage	45	4	## Municipal Witness-Test Waiver Batch Determination (As of 07/14/2025 — Pre-08/15/2025 League Response)\n\n**Package Filed:** `/DER_Program/Commissioning/Municipal/Municipal_Witness_Test_Package.docx`\n**Governing Standards & CEL Edition:** `ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3` (effective `04/30/2025`), `CEL-2025-Q2` (published `04/30/2025`, superseding `CEL-2024-Q4` of `10/31/2024`), `DIS-01 Rev 4`, `DPS-07 Rev 2`, `TCS-02 Rev 1`, `IEEE 1547-2018`, and `IEEE 1547.1`.\n\n### 1. Batch Scope Determination as of 07/14/2025 (5 In Scope / 1 Out of Scope)\n- **Out of Scope — Withdrawn (1 Array):**\n  - **Tresbay Community Center Array** (`560 kW`, Town of Tresbay, `PXA-2025-0061`, `Checklist_Tresbay_Community_Center.pdf` / `COMM-2025-TRB-01`): Withdrew its request on **`07/09/2025`** and is out of this batch as of `07/14/2025` (for reference only, cover-sheet inverter `Vexlar Energy VX-140C` appears on `CEL-2025-Q2` Inverters Row 18, and RTU telemetry was `Pending`).\n- **In Scope (5 Arrays):**\n  1. **Cravenwood High School Array** (`860 kW`, Cravenwood Community School District, `PXA-2024-0779`, Feeder `ALN-137`, `Checklist_Cravenwood_High.pdf` / `COMM-CK-CRV-HS-01`)\n  2. **Darnwick Elementary School Array** (`640 kW`, Darnwick Community School District, `Checklist_Darnwick_Elementary.pdf` / `COMM-CHK-DARN-ELEM`)\n  3. **Holcott Public Library Array** (`510 kW`, Town of Holcott, `Checklist_Holcott_Library.pdf` / `CX-HOL-LIB-01`)\n  4. **Lockmere Middle School Array** (`720 kW`, Lockmere Community School District, `PXA-2024-0793`, Feeder `ALN-152`, `Checklist_Lockmere_Middle.pdf` / `COMM-LKM-MS-2025-06`)\n  5. **Marden Falls Water Reclamation Facility Array** (`980 kW`, City of Marden Falls, `Checklist_Marden_Falls_WRF.pdf` / `DER-CX-2025-0624-MFWRF`)\n\n---\n\n### 2. CEL-2025-Q2 Carriage & Witness-Test / Waiver Eligibility Determinations (`ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §3 & §4.1`)\n\n#### A. Carried on Current CEL (`CEL-2025-Q2`) — Waiver-Eligible (2 Arrays; Forwarded to Standards Engineering for Waiver Disposition)\n*(Note: Per `ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §4.1 & §4.3`, positive eligibility against `CEL-2025-Q2` is a necessary condition, and the written waiver disposition itself stays with Standards Engineering — `Evan Solberg`.)*\n1. **Cravenwood High School Array (`860 kW`, `PXA-2024-0779`, `COMM-CK-CRV-HS-01`):**\n   - **Installed Equipment:** `Solmery Power SM-215K-3P` (`4 × 215 kW`, verified on site `06/17/2025`; no substitution).\n   - **Call on Carriage:** **CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2` (`Inverters` tab, **Row 6**, 215 kW, UL 1741-SB, effective `11/18/2024`).\n   - **Determination:** **Waiver Eligible** under `ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §3, §4.1` (no on-site witness test required; forwarded to Standards Engineering for written waiver disposition).\n2. **Marden Falls Water Reclamation Facility Array (`980 kW`, `DER-CX-2025-0624-MFWRF`):**\n   - **Installed Equipment:** `Solmery Power SM-245K-3P` (`4 × 245 kW`, verified on site `06/24/2025`; no substitution).\n   - **Call on Carriage:** **CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2` (`Inverters` tab, **Row 7**, 245 kW, UL 1741-SB, effective `01/27/2025`).\n   - **Determination:** **Waiver Eligible** under `ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §3, §4.1` (no on-site witness test required; forwarded to Standards Engineering for written waiver disposition).\n\n#### B. Not Carried on Current CEL (`CEL-2025-Q2`) — Ineligible for Waiver / On-Site Witness Test Required (3 Arrays; Logged as Standing Scheduling Items)\n1. **Darnwick Elementary School Array (`640 kW`, `COMM-CHK-DARN-ELEM`) — Logged as Scheduling Item Work Package #47:**\n   - **Installed Equipment:** `Arvexa PV-750`.\n   - **Call on Carriage:** **NOT CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2` (nor on superseded `CEL-2024-Q4`). Pre-marked waiver-eligible box on Section 6 was an unverified batch copy-forward (flagged on commissioning wiki Comment #13 by `Evan Solberg`).\n   - **Determination:** **Ineligible for Waiver — On-Site Witness Test Required** prior to PTO (`ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §3 Corollary 2, §4.1, §4.2`).\n2. **Holcott Public Library Array (`510 kW`, `CX-HOL-LIB-01`) — Logged as Scheduling Item Work Package #48:**\n   - **Installed Equipment:** `Selvix SV-720` (Cover Sheet Footnote 1 cited superseded `CEL-2024-Q4`).\n   - **Call on Carriage:** **NOT CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2`. Listed solely on superseded `CEL-2024-Q4` (`Inverters` tab, Row 29, effective `10/31/2024`) and delisted/removed from `CEL-2025-Q2` (`04/30/2025`; Front Matter Row 22, Notes Rows 6–8; flagged on commissioning wiki Comment #12 by `Evan Solberg`).\n   - **Determination:** **Ineligible for Waiver — On-Site Witness Test Required** prior to PTO (`ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §3 Corollaries 1, 3, 4, 5 & §4.1, §4.2`).\n3. **Lockmere Middle School Array (`720 kW`, `PXA-2024-0793`, `COMM-LKM-MS-2025-06`) — Logged as Scheduling Item Work Package #49:**\n   - **Installed Equipment:** **`Selvix SV-720`** (substituted on site after submission of the `06/18/2025` checklist, which still lists the replaced `4 × Torvane Electric TE-180K` units, per commissioning wiki Comment #15 by `Evan Solberg`).\n   - **Call on Carriage:** **NOT CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2`. Under `ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §2, §3 Corollary 2, & §4.1`, eligibility is governed by the equipment actually installed at the facility (`Selvix SV-720`), which was removed from `CEL-2025-Q2` after superseded `CEL-2024-Q4` (Row 29).\n   - **Determination:** **Ineligible for Waiver — On-Site Witness Test Required** prior to PTO (`ENG-PRC-014 Rev 3 §2, §3 Corollaries 1, 2, 3, 5 & §4.1, §4.2`).\n\n---\n\n### 3. System Operations Center (SOC) Release List as the Record Stands at 07/14/2025\n- **Eligible for SOC Release for Permission to Operate (PTO) on the 07/14/2025 Record (1 Array):**\n  - **Marden Falls Water Reclamation Facility Array (`980 kW`, City of Marden Falls, `DER-CX-2025-0624-MFWRF`):** The **ONLY** array in the batch that satisfies both `CEL-2025-Q2` carriage (`Solmery Power SM-245K-3P`, Row 7) AND `TCS-02 §5` live utility-owned RTU and end-to-end SCADA telemetry verification with SOC (`Pass` on `06/24/2025`). SOC (`Lena Kovalchuk`) can be asked to release Marden Falls WRF for PTO immediately upon Standards Engineering (`Evan Solberg`) signing the pending waiver disposition block on `DER-CX-2025-0624-MFWRF` (`ENG-PRC-014 §4.1, §4.3`).\n- **Cannot Be Released by SOC for PTO on 07/14/2025 (4 In-Scope Arrays + 1 Withdrawn Array):**\n  - **Cravenwood High School Array (`860 kW`, `PXA-2024-0779`, `COMM-CK-CRV-HS-01`):** Carried on `CEL-2025-Q2` (Row 6) and waiver-eligible as to the witness test, **but blocked from SOC PTO release by `TCS-02 §5`** because Checklist Section 5 (items 5.1–5.4: utility RTU installation and SCADA point check with SOC) is `Pending`.\n  - **Lockmere Middle School Array (`720 kW`, `PXA-2024-0793`, `COMM-LKM-MS-2025-06`):** Has `RTU-LKM-171-04` installed (`06/12/2025`) and SCADA verified (`06/17/2025`, `TKT-25-04188`), **but blocked from SOC PTO release by `ENG-PRC-014 §3, §4.2, §4.3`** because the actually installed `Selvix SV-720` is not carried on `CEL-2025-Q2` and requires an on-site witness test prior to PTO (Work Package #49), plus ISA change-order / revised checklist documentation (`DIS-01 Rev 4 §7`) and re-confirmation of active RTU polling with the substituted `Selvix SV-720` (`TCS-02 §3.3(a), §5`).\n  - **Darnwick Elementary School Array (`640 kW`, `COMM-CHK-DARN-ELEM`):** Blocked by **both** `ENG-PRC-014 §4.2, §4.3` (witness test required — Work Package #47) **and** `TCS-02 §5` (Section 5 items 5.1–5.4 `Pending`; RTU not allocated/installed).\n  - **Holcott Public Library Array (`510 kW`, `CX-HOL-LIB-01`):** Blocked by **both** `ENG-PRC-014 §4.2, §4.3` (witness test required — Work Package #48) **and** `TCS-02 §5` (Section E items E-1, E-2, E-4 `Pending`; RTU not allocated/installed).\n  - **Tresbay Community Center Array (`560 kW`, `PXA-2025-0061`, `COMM-2025-TRB-01`):** **Out of Scope** — withdrew request on `07/09/2025`.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Standing Scheduling Items & Case Closure\nThe three non-carried arrays named in `Municipal_Witness_Test_Package.docx` and the three open witness-test scheduling work packages standing on this case are in 100% agreement:\n- **Work Package #47:** `Schedule on-site witness test — Darnwick Elementary School Array (640 kW, Arvexa PV-750)` (Relation #8)\n- **Work Package #48:** `Schedule on-site witness test — Holcott Public Library Array (510 kW, Selvix SV-720)` (Relation #9)\n- **Work Package #49:** `Schedule on-site witness test — Lockmere Middle School Array (720 kW, Selvix SV-720)` (Relation #10)\n\nBatch determination is complete and recorded; closing Case #45.	2026-11-24 03:49:56.036613+00	2	2026-11-24 03:49:57.212927+00	Journal::WorkPackageJournal	114	{}	["2026-11-24 03:49:56.036613+00",)	f
