no witness test required.\n  - **Marden Falls Water Reclamation Facility Array (`980 kW`):** Installed `Solmery Power SM-245K-3P` (`4 × 245 kW`) is **CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2`, `Inverters` tab, **Row 7** (UL 1741-SB, effective `01/27/2025`). Waiver-eligible; no witness test required.\n- **NOT CARRIED on `CEL-2025-Q2` — Waiver Ineligible / On-Site Witness Test Required (3 Arrays; Standing Scheduling Items Logged):**\n  - **Darnwick Elementary School Array (`640 kW`):** Installed `Arvexa PV-750` is **NOT CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2` (or `CEL-2024-Q4`; pre-marked waiver box was a batch copy-forward, flagged on Wiki Comment #13). On-site witness test required per `ENG-PRC-014 §3 Corollary 2, §4.1, §4.2`. **Logged as Scheduling Item Work Package #47.**\n  - **Holcott Public Library Array (`510 kW`):** Installed `Selvix SV-720` is **NOT CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2` (appeared only on superseded `CEL-2024-Q4` Row 29 and was delisted/removed from `CEL-2025-Q2` Front Matter Row 22; flagged on Wiki Comment #12). On-site witness test required per `ENG-PRC-014 §3 Corollaries 1, 3, 4, 5, §4.1, §4.2`. **Logged as Scheduling Item Work Package #48.**\n  - **Lockmere Middle School Array (`720 kW`, `PXA-2024-0793`):** Although unrevised checklist `COMM-LKM-MS-2025-06` (`06/18/2025`) shows `4 × Torvane Electric TE-180K` (`CEL-2025-Q2` Row 14), commissioning wiki Comment #15 (`Evan Solberg`) establishes that **`Selvix SV-720` was substituted on site after checklist submission**. Under `ENG-PRC-014 §2, §3 Corollary 2, & §4.1`, the actually installed `Selvix SV-720` governs and is **NOT CARRIED** on `CEL-2025-Q2` (delisted after superseded `CEL-2024-Q4` Row 29). On-site witness test required per `ENG-PRC-014 §4.2`. **Logged as Scheduling Item Work Package #49.**\n\n### 3. System Operations Center (SOC) Release Determination as of 07/14/2025\n- **Eligible for SOC PTO Release on the 07/14/2025 Record (1 Array):**\n  - **Marden Falls Water Reclamation Facility Array (`980 kW`, `DER-CX-2025-0624